# /m11-rdf/
#
# https://w3id.org/m11-rdf/ is the namespace for a draft RDF rendering of
# ICH M11 protocol elements and sections, with mapping statements to the
# usdm-rdf rendering of CDISC USDM v4. Maintained in kerfors/m11-rdf.
# Slash semantics. An element IRI is <namespace codelist>.<concept code>
# (e.g. C217356.C132352), the pair as stated in the ICH M11 Technical
# Specification; a section IRI is C217272.<section term code>.
#
# Rule: a browser gets the page at the same path on the GitHub Pages site
# of kerfors/m11-rdf, one page per IRI; an RDF client gets the whole graph
# (Turtle, N-Triples, RDF/XML or JSON-LD; default Turtle). A version IRI
# (bare-numeric path, e.g. /0.1.0) resolves to the Turtle at that release
# tag through one generic rule, so a release needs no change here. Paths
# ending in a file extension (graph files, mapping sets) pass through to
# the site unchanged.
#
# Status: draft, not normative. Not an ICH, CDISC or HL7 artifact. If ICH
# or CDISC mint official IRIs for M11 elements, the IRIs here get
# owl:sameAs to them and are deprecated. See README.md.
#
# ## Contact
# Kerstin Forsberg
# kerstin.l.forsberg@gmail.com
# GitHub username: kerfors

RewriteEngine on

# Version IRIs: /X.Y.Z resolves to the Turtle at release tag vX.Y.Z.
RewriteRule ^([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kerfors/m11-rdf/v$1/m11-rdf.ttl [R=303,L]

# Files on the site: graph serializations and mapping sets, path kept.
RewriteRule ^([A-Za-z0-9_-]+(\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]+)*\.(ttl|nt|rdf|jsonld|tsv))$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/$1 [R=302,L]

# RDF clients: the whole graph, current release.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/n-triples
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/m11-rdf.nt [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/m11-rdf.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/ld\+json
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/m11-rdf.jsonld [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/m11-rdf.ttl [R=303,L]

# Browsers: the page at the same path.
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/xhtml\+xml [OR]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_USER_AGENT} ^Mozilla/.*
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/$1 [R=303,L]

# Default (no Accept header, programmatic clients): the whole graph as Turtle.
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://kerfors.github.io/m11-rdf/m11-rdf.ttl [R=303,L]
